Keeps this folder in git.

public/admin/config.yml declares it as `media_folder`. Sveltia asks GitHub's
contents API for it when the media library opens, and an absent folder returns
a 404 -- which surfaces to Eric as a broken CMS rather than an empty library.

Git does not track empty directories, so this file is what makes the path real.
Image uploads are disabled in the CMS on purpose (see HANDBOOK.md Part 5), so
this folder is expected to stay empty.
